<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (Q: Raising capital in the sustainable fertilizers sector comes with challenges, especially around regulatory frameworks and policies. What were the biggest challenges you faced during this round, and how did you overcome them? )
/E (Q: Raising capital in the sustainable fertilizers sector comes with challenges, especially around regulatory frameworks and policies. What were the biggest challenges you faced during this round, and how did you overcome them? )
/Pg 50 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
1865 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/T (A: At Switch, we see regulatory agencies not as a challenge but as partners who we work with from day one to ensure our products are safe and compliant. They are stewards of human health, agriculture and the environment, and so are we.)
/E (A: At Switch, we see regulatory agencies not as a challenge but as partners who we work with from day one to ensure our products are safe and compliant. They are stewards of human health, agriculture and the environment, and so are we.)
/Pg 50 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
1866 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (Q: From your recent fundraising success, what key advice would you give to other climate tech founders seeking investment? )
/E (Q: From your recent fundraising success, what key advice would you give to other climate tech founders seeking investment? )
/Pg 50 0 R
/K [13]
>>
endobj
1867 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/T (A: Raise money when you don't yet need it. And then raise more than you think you need. Find investors that deeply care about you and the mission -beyond words and money.)
/E (A: Raise money when you don't yet need it. And then raise more than you think you need. Find investors that deeply care about you and the mission -beyond words and money.)
/Pg 50 0 R
/K [14]
>>
