1875 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/T (Dr. Tim Schnabel is a bioengineer, entrepreneur, and Forbes 30 Under 30 honoree in social impact. He is the Founder and CEO of Switch Bioworks, a biotechnology company in San Carlos, California, focused on engineering microbes for sustainable fertilizer production.  Tim studied chemical engineering and economics at Stanford University, where he received multiple awards for his research on biological hydrogen fuel production. He later earned his PhD in bioengineering at Stanford, where his work on ammonia production in diazotrophs led to patents and publications. Tim is also a BioX Bowes Fellow and Accel Leadership Fellow.)
/E (Dr. Tim Schnabel is a bioengineer, entrepreneur, and Forbes 30 Under 30 honoree in social impact. He is the Founder and CEO of Switch Bioworks, a biotechnology company in San Carlos, California, focused on engineering microbes for sustainable fertilizer production.  Tim studied chemical engineering and economics at Stanford University, where he received multiple awards for his research on biological hydrogen fuel production. He later earned his PhD in bioengineering at Stanford, where his work on ammonia production in diazotrophs led to patents and publications. Tim is also a BioX Bowes Fellow and Accel Leadership Fellow.)
/Pg 50 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
1876 0 obj
<<
