1950 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (Q: How does Climate Capital mitigate risk while identifying and scaling opportunities, given the high level of investment activity that frequently places you among the most active investors?)
/E (Q: How does Climate Capital mitigate risk while identifying and scaling opportunities, given the high level of investment activity that frequently places you among the most active investors?)
/Pg 55 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
1951 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/T (A: It is impossible to fully mitigate risk as an early-stage investor. As we move through the process of due diligence, our job is to try and align "what needs to be true" in order for a company to reach a certain return profile and develop an analysis that shows the gap between that and our best estimation of reality over the next 7-10 years. The quality of the founding team is what helps us get comfortable with the size of that gap.)
/E (A: It is impossible to fully mitigate risk as an early-stage investor. As we move through the process of due diligence, our job is to try and align "what needs to be true" in order for a company to reach a certain return profile and develop an analysis that shows the gap between that and our best estimation of reality over the next 7-10 years. The quality of the founding team is what helps us get comfortable with the size of that gap.)
/Pg 55 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
1952 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (Q: What challenges do you anticipate in scaling climate tech hardware solutions? What structural changes in traditional investment models are needed to enable substantial investments in these solutions at a larger scale?)
/E (Q: What challenges do you anticipate in scaling climate tech hardware solutions? What structural changes in traditional investment models are needed to enable substantial investments in these solutions at a larger scale?)
/Pg 55 0 R
/K [13]
>>
endobj
1953 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/T (A: Financing for manufacturing hardware at scale is a big one. There need to continue to be risk-takers at each stage who know how to evaluate and structure financing tools for companies who are becoming too mature for venture capital, but have yet to be truly at-scale. Climate tech hardware companies are often taking swings at $BBB industries, which require incredibly high volumes.)
/E (A: Financing for manufacturing hardware at scale is a big one. There need to continue to be risk-takers at each stage who know how to evaluate and structure financing tools for companies who are becoming too mature for venture capital, but have yet to be truly at-scale. Climate tech hardware companies are often taking swings at $BBB industries, which require incredibly high volumes.)
/Pg 55 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
